{title: Sing To The Lord}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

>Lyrics

Sing to the Lord and praise His name.

Sing to the Lord in glad refrain.

Sing to the Lord, His banner raise.

Bring forth a song of thankful praise!

Glory and honor belong to the Savior;

Praise and thanksgiving we gratefully bring.

All the glory and honor belong to the Savior

Who brought us the victory;

By His grace alone we are free!

Tell what the Lord has done for you.

Declare how the Lord makes all things new.

Tell of the joy you've found in Him.

Share how your soul has been born again!

Glory and honor belong to our Savior;

Praise and thanksgiving we gratefully bring.

All the glory and honor belong to our Savior

Who brought us the victory,

Removed our transgressions,

Gave life everlasting;

By His grace alone we are free!
